<!--
    Monochrome variant for Android 13+ themed icons.

    Identical geometry to `ic_bolmitra_emblem`, with every fill left black: the platform ignores the
    colours here and tints the whole drawable from the wallpaper palette, so anything but a single
    flat fill just risks a muddy silhouette.

    The centre figure is cut back to a ring rather than a solid disc, and thin gaps are kept between
    the pages, because a themed icon is a flat one-colour stamp — without those separations the three
    figures and the book would merge into one blob.
-->
